    <name>
      <text>9.4 Multiplying out brackets (including 3)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Expand the brackets and collect like terms:</p>
<p>(a) \({@expr1@}=\)[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]][[feedback:prt1]]</p>
<p>(b) \({@expr2@}=\)[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]][[feedback:prt2]]</p>
<p>(c)  \({@expr3@}=\)[[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]][[feedback:prt3]]</p>
<p>(d) \(({@fac_1@})({@fac_2@})({@fac_3@})=\) [[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]][[feedback:prt4]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
